  "Optional raw filter, ANDed onto the filters above. See Clay's advanced search query syntax: https://developers.clay.com/searches/advanced": "可选的原始筛选器，按与运算追加到上方筛选条件中。请参阅 Clay 的高级搜索查询语法：https://developers.clay.com/searches/advanced",
  "Matches similar titles too (e.g. \"VP of Sales\" also matches \"Head of Sales\").": "也匹配相似标题（例如，\"VP of Sales\" 也会匹配 \"Head of Sales\"）。",
  "Matches people at these exact companies. Scoped by Employment Tenure above.": "匹配这些指定公司的人员。受上方任职时长限制约束。",
